Public Profiles:
- makes the existing search controls functional;
- adds optional ZIP + distance search;
- geographic filtering compares the Census ZIP-area point only with moderator-approved approximate public_case_map_points;
- profiles without an approved public map point are excluded from ZIP-distance results rather than falling back to private location data.

Admin urgent alerts:
- adds audience preview and explicit urgent send control;
- requires an approved published profile, urgency_level=urgent_public_awareness, and an approved public map point;
- requires typing SEND URGENT ALERT and a final browser confirmation;
- raw submissions never auto-send;
- the current synthetic rehearsal lock blocks every real-person alert send server-side (HTTP 423) and permits only clearly named MMIPS TEST PERSON synthetic profiles.
- uses the existing per-subscriber delivery ledger and signed unsubscribe links.

Database:
- records the production email_normalized upsert-arbiter repair;
- adds private subscriber ZIP/radius/generalized ZCTA fields;
- adds a service-role-only urgent_alert_events ledger.

Policy/tests:
- updates Privacy and Data Policy disclosures;
- adds Census ZIP lookup/distance unit coverage and static privacy/safety contracts.

